## Errors of the `instance` module.

instance-invalid-id = “{ $id }” is not a valid instance ID. IDs use lowercase letters a to z, digits and single hyphens, up to 48 characters.
instance-invalid-name = An instance name needs 1 to { $max } characters.
instance-exists = An instance with the ID “{ $id }” exists already.
instance-not-found = There is no instance “{ $id }”.
instance-running = The instance “{ $id }” is running. Close the game first.
instance-trash-failed = Could not move the instance “{ $id }” to the trash ({ $reason }). It is still there. You can delete it permanently instead.
